Rail Island — Source-Available License (English summary, non-authoritative)

The source is published so that anyone may inspect it and independently verify
how this service handles user data. Public visibility does not grant free reuse.

You MAY read, study, modify and run the code locally for personal, research or
educational purposes, and contribute issues and pull requests.

You MAY NOT deploy, operate or distribute any public-facing service, application
or derivative product based on all or a substantial part of this project
(whether or not for a fee) — including ports to other platforms such as Android
or desktop, and submissions to any app store — nor use it for any commercial
purpose, without prior written permission. The names and logos "軌島" /
"Rail Island" are not licensed.

Contributions merged into this project are licensed to the project under these
same terms, and may be relicensed by the copyright holder, including commercially.

Files under `data/` derive from third parties (MOTC TDX, OpenStreetMap, official
Taiwan Railway open data, MOI administrative boundary data and others) and remain
subject to their own terms; OpenStreetMap-derived content is under ODbL, whose
share-alike obligation the author cannot waive, and the MOI boundary data is under
Taiwan's Open Government Data License v1.0, which requires attribution. Audio under `suno musics/` is licensed to the
author only, conditional on generation during the author's paid Suno
subscription, and is NOT sublicensed to anyone — the absence of a per-file
license notice does not imply free use. Third-party services called at runtime
require your own valid credentials; none are included.

Provided "as is", without warranty of any kind. Train positions shown are
estimates, not official operational information. Not a navigation or safety tool.

Exceptions are negotiable — open an issue or email support@railisland.tw.
The Traditional Chinese text above is the authoritative version.
